<section background-color="heading" id="bbs030" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Inverse-ground closing, the heading color as the card fill: thanks, next steps and contact block on the left, one image region on the right for the brand's own graphic.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item colspan="36" vertical-align="center" id="VRx3_rz2ln"><h1>Thank you</h1><p font-size="lg">Decisions from today go to the regional managers on Friday; the plan is reviewed again in September.</p><spacer size="24pt"></spacer><p font-size="sm">Northwind Supply · plan@northwind.example · northwind.example</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="24" padding="0" id="rY_ftKMl2T"><ai-image prompt="Image in this deck's authored imagery style" background="true" meta='{"width":1440,"height":2560}' /></grid-item></grid></section>